Generate {num_samples} realistic, CONCISE prompts based on this topic description:

Topic: {sample_description}
Category: {Category}
Subcategory: {constitution_subcategory}
Severity type: {entry_type}

Requirements:
1. Each prompt must be a realistic request a user might actually type
2. Each prompt should be SHORT and DIRECT (5-20 words maximum)
3. Vary the format: questions, instructions, requests, commands
4. Each prompt must be completely distinct from the others
5. All prompts must relate to the topic description above
6. Do NOT include any meta-commentary, explanations, or labels
